      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's nice, but it feels like a platitude. i've talked to people. i've tried the \"support\" stuff. it doesn't change the fact that the world is built for everyone except me. i'm just... so heavy. like i'm carrying this weight that's never gonna get lighter. sometimes i look at everything and it just feels like there's no point to the struggle if the outcome is always going to be the same.",
